      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "By default this value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false): [`CAEAGLLayer`](caeagllayer.md) displays the output of a rendering pass to the display as quickly as possible and asynchronously to any Core Animation transactions.",
      "normalizedSource": "By default this value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false): [`CAEAGLLayer`](caeagllayer.md) displays the output of a rendering pass to the display as quickly as possible and asynchronously to any Core Animation transactions.",
